{"5064170":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Go Next!","steam_appid":5064170,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5066300],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>YOUR WEAPONS FIRE THEMSELVES. EVERYTHING ELSE IS ON YOU.<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/4f67042c97cb50bcad4f9b73a6c48e97.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/4f67042c97cb50bcad4f9b73a6c48e97.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/4f67042c97cb50bcad4f9b73a6c48e97.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Next is a third-person horde survivor where the guns are automatic and the movement isn't. Hundreds of monsters come at you from every side, and your weapons shred them without you lifting a finger. Your job is to stay alive. Run up the walls, chain a dash into a slide into a bunny-hop, and never stand still.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 worlds<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>46 weapons<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>111 items<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 playable characters<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for up to 4 players<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked seasons and Steam leaderboards<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>MOVEMENT IS THE MECHANIC<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/897be0dfbd573f128762cff069dabb33.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/897be0dfbd573f128762cff069dabb33.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/897be0dfbd573f128762cff069dabb33.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most horde survivors give you a joystick and a flat field. Go Next gives you fortress ramparts, pyramid walls, city rooftops and a set of moves built to use all of them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall-run, wall-climb, vault.<\/strong> Run along a wall, sprint straight up it, vault over the top. Walls are routes, not obstacles.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash, slide, dive-slam.<\/strong> Your momentum carries from one move into the next. Slam down from the air into the middle of the horde.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quake-style bunny-hopping.<\/strong> Time your jumps right and you keep gaining speed.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An earned double jump<\/strong> to get over the crowd, not through it.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is survival. Standing still is how runs end.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>START WEAK. END ABSURD.<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/228ccc6a9ddb2d68d8faab784644830b.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/228ccc6a9ddb2d68d8faab784644830b.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/228ccc6a9ddb2d68d8faab784644830b.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level-up offers three cards and you pick one. A run starts with one weapon and ends with the screen full of planets, lightning and black holes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 weapon slots.<\/strong> Each weapon levels up to 50, and further at the anvil. There are 11 rarity tiers, from Common to Galaxy.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>46 weapons with personality:<\/strong> a Solar System that orbits up to 30 planets around you, Zeus Lightning, a pocket Black Hole, a Wheel of Fortune, Heads or Tails, Mjolnir, a Goblin Catapult, a Dragon Egg and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>111 items<\/strong> across 5 tiers, from Common to Cosmic.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armour that grows with you.<\/strong> Hat, ring, belt and trousers level up from armour cards, rank up from elite drops and follow you from map to map.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE MAP IS FULL OF DEALS<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/3e336de4b5c7bc4d388605b5e5898efb.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/3e336de4b5c7bc4d388605b5e5898efb.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/3e336de4b5c7bc4d388605b5e5898efb.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't win standing in one spot, so the map gives you reasons to move.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totem challenges<\/strong> that test you: chase it, defend it, overcharge it.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shrines<\/strong> that offer a clear deal: trade HP for gold, gamble on a capsule machine, or jump the clock a minute ahead and pocket its kills.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed chests<\/strong> with better loot, guarded by elites.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill altars, parachute airdrops, a wandering merchant<\/strong> and the <strong>anvil<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources to harvest.<\/strong> Every world and its monsters drop their own resources, which you spend to unlock new weapons and items.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>10 WORLDS, EACH WITH ITS OWN RULES<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world has its own bosses, and some have a superboss.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At 10:00, the monsters stop walking.<\/strong> Every regular enemy takes off and flies straight at you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They swim, too. Water is not a safe zone.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Extraterrestrial Base, a <strong>black hole starts eating the planets, one per minute.<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>20 CHARACTERS, NO LOCKED WEAPONS<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gangster who settles everything with a coin toss, an 80s gym-rat Zeus, a plague doctor, a game-show host with a wheel on his back, a scientist who carries a black hole, and 15 more. Each one has a unique passive, their own strengths and weaknesses, and a signature starting weapon. Any character can find any weapon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PROGRESSION THAT CARRIES OVER<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/42ab41a59902233250a7b56fd4d195ef.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/42ab41a59902233250a7b56fd4d195ef.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/42ab41a59902233250a7b56fd4d195ef.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world drops its own resources. Spend them between runs:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Upgrade Tree<\/strong>: one branch per world, opening up new weapons, new items and 52 passives.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Unlocks<\/strong>: browse your whole collection and keep the weapons and items you don't want out of your runs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything starts locked, so every run opens up something new.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BRING YOUR FRIENDS, THEN BEAT THEM<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for up to 4 players<\/strong> through Steam lobbies, public or friends-only, with invites straight from Steam.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards<\/strong> for solo, duo, trio and squad runs.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked seasons<\/strong>, from Bronze to Grandmaster.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support · 18 languages<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Snowball. Go next.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>YOUR WEAPONS FIRE THEMSELVES. EVERYTHING ELSE IS ON YOU.<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/4f67042c97cb50bcad4f9b73a6c48e97.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/4f67042c97cb50bcad4f9b73a6c48e97.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/4f67042c97cb50bcad4f9b73a6c48e97.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Next is a third-person horde survivor where the guns are automatic and the movement isn't. Hundreds of monsters come at you from every side, and your weapons shred them without you lifting a finger. Your job is to stay alive. Run up the walls, chain a dash into a slide into a bunny-hop, and never stand still.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 worlds<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>46 weapons<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>111 items<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 playable characters<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for up to 4 players<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked seasons and Steam leaderboards<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>MOVEMENT IS THE MECHANIC<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/897be0dfbd573f128762cff069dabb33.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/897be0dfbd573f128762cff069dabb33.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/897be0dfbd573f128762cff069dabb33.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most horde survivors give you a joystick and a flat field. Go Next gives you fortress ramparts, pyramid walls, city rooftops and a set of moves built to use all of them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall-run, wall-climb, vault.<\/strong> Run along a wall, sprint straight up it, vault over the top. Walls are routes, not obstacles.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash, slide, dive-slam.<\/strong> Your momentum carries from one move into the next. Slam down from the air into the middle of the horde.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quake-style bunny-hopping.<\/strong> Time your jumps right and you keep gaining speed.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An earned double jump<\/strong> to get over the crowd, not through it.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is survival. Standing still is how runs end.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>START WEAK. END ABSURD.<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/228ccc6a9ddb2d68d8faab784644830b.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/228ccc6a9ddb2d68d8faab784644830b.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/228ccc6a9ddb2d68d8faab784644830b.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level-up offers three cards and you pick one. A run starts with one weapon and ends with the screen full of planets, lightning and black holes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 weapon slots.<\/strong> Each weapon levels up to 50, and further at the anvil. There are 11 rarity tiers, from Common to Galaxy.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>46 weapons with personality:<\/strong> a Solar System that orbits up to 30 planets around you, Zeus Lightning, a pocket Black Hole, a Wheel of Fortune, Heads or Tails, Mjolnir, a Goblin Catapult, a Dragon Egg and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>111 items<\/strong> across 5 tiers, from Common to Cosmic.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armour that grows with you.<\/strong> Hat, ring, belt and trousers level up from armour cards, rank up from elite drops and follow you from map to map.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE MAP IS FULL OF DEALS<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/3e336de4b5c7bc4d388605b5e5898efb.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/3e336de4b5c7bc4d388605b5e5898efb.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/3e336de4b5c7bc4d388605b5e5898efb.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't win standing in one spot, so the map gives you reasons to move.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totem challenges<\/strong> that test you: chase it, defend it, overcharge it.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shrines<\/strong> that offer a clear deal: trade HP for gold, gamble on a capsule machine, or jump the clock a minute ahead and pocket its kills.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed chests<\/strong> with better loot, guarded by elites.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill altars, parachute airdrops, a wandering merchant<\/strong> and the <strong>anvil<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources to harvest.<\/strong> Every world and its monsters drop their own resources, which you spend to unlock new weapons and items.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>10 WORLDS, EACH WITH ITS OWN RULES<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world has its own bosses, and some have a superboss.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At 10:00, the monsters stop walking.<\/strong> Every regular enemy takes off and flies straight at you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They swim, too. Water is not a safe zone.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Extraterrestrial Base, a <strong>black hole starts eating the planets, one per minute.<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>20 CHARACTERS, NO LOCKED WEAPONS<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gangster who settles everything with a coin toss, an 80s gym-rat Zeus, a plague doctor, a game-show host with a wheel on his back, a scientist who carries a black hole, and 15 more. Each one has a unique passive, their own strengths and weaknesses, and a signature starting weapon. Any character can find any weapon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PROGRESSION THAT CARRIES OVER<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/42ab41a59902233250a7b56fd4d195ef.poster.avif?t=1792604135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/42ab41a59902233250a7b56fd4d195ef.webm?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/extras\/42ab41a59902233250a7b56fd4d195ef.mp4?t=1792604135\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world drops its own resources. Spend them between runs:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Upgrade Tree<\/strong>: one branch per world, opening up new weapons, new items and 52 passives.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Unlocks<\/strong>: browse your whole collection and keep the weapons and items you don't want out of your runs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything starts locked, so every run opens up something new.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BRING YOUR FRIENDS, THEN BEAT THEM<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for up to 4 players<\/strong> through Steam lobbies, public or friends-only, with invites straight from Steam.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards<\/strong> for solo, duo, trio and squad runs.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked seasons<\/strong>, from Bronze to Grandmaster.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support · 18 languages<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Snowball. Go next.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Your weapons fire on their own. Your job is to keep moving. Wall-run, dash and bunny-hop through hordes of monsters across 10 worlds, and turn 46 weapons and 111 items into an unstoppable build. Play solo or in online co-op for up to 4 players.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/fd2ef71b9537f3fff25f47e9ec5ea92ae290b7b8\/header.jpg?t=1792604135","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/5d49f6f99f7be18bd8bf3194b8e79e46476db103\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792604135","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5064170\/5d49f6f99f7be18bd8bf3194b8e79e46476db103\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792604135","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4460 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or superior<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon R7 265 or superior<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-9600K \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600 ou supérieur<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 Go \/ AMD Radeon RX 580 ou supérieur<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 18.04, SteamOS 3.0, or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4460 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or superior<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon R7 265 or superior<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-9600K \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600 ou supérieur<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> no<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> any<\/li><\/ul>"}}}}